      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso (first section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[&ldquo;&lsquo;...out of your tomb like a det]ested [netzer&rsquo;.&rdquo;</li>\n<li>[And it was decreed upon him, and they cut]</li>\n<li>his head [off]. They brought</li>\n<li>Todah. He said to him: &ldquo;Why</li>\n<li>are you called Todah?&rdquo; He said to him:</li>\n<li>&ldquo;About me David said, &ldquo;A psalm</li>\n<li>for todah&rsquo;.&rdquo; [He said] to him: &ldquo;Fool!</li>\n<li>D[avid said about yo]u, &lsquo;He who</li>\n<li>sacrifices [todah h]onors me&rsquo;.&rdquo; And he decreed</li>\n<li>[upon him, and they executed (?)] him.</li>\n<li>(P[ilatus the governor]) answered</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
